  "adaptations": [
    "Place owner cache/Data preparation after allocation of the actual user scratch page.",
    "Place App cryptex helper before its caller and invoke it from macOS Data preparation.",
    "Bind owner boot manifest to this candidate OS UUID, never the iPadOS reference UUID.",
